  "solution": "Given equation: 12 $ 4 & 2 = 50\n\nLet's check each option one by one.\n\n**Option 1) $ = ×, & = +**\n\n⇒ 12 × 4 + 2 = 50\n\n⇒ **48** + 2 = 50\n\n⇒ **50 = 50**\n\n⇒ LHS = RHS \n\n**Option 2) $ = +, & = ×**\n\n⇒ 12 + 4 × 2 = 50\n\n⇒ 12 + **8** = 50\n\n⇒ 20 ≠ 50\n\n⇒ LHS ≠ RHS\n\n**Option 3) $ = –, & = ×**\n\n⇒ 12 – 4 × 2 = 50\n\n⇒ 12 – **8** = 50\n\n⇒ 4 ≠ 50\n\n⇒ LHS ≠ RHS\n\n**Option 4) $ = ÷, & = +**\n\n⇒ 12 ÷ 4 + 2 = 50\n\n⇒ **3** + 2 = 50\n\n⇒ 5 ≠ 50\n\n⇒ LHS ≠ RHS\n\nHence, the correct answer is **\"Option 1\"**.",
